<item><title>Ravatomanga family seeks answers over search of its tomb</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/ravatomanga-family-seeks-answers-over-search-of-its-tomb-169dfa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/ravatomanga-family-seeks-answers-over-search-of-its-tomb-169dfa/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>Lawyers say people claiming a prosecutor’s mandate searched the family tomb in Moratsiazo and reported finding nothing.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 05:52:15 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar&apos;s ousted Assembly president asks court to annul his removal</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-ousted-assembly-president-asks-court-to-annul-ac0c15/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-ousted-assembly-president-asks-court-to-annul-ac0c15/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>Siteny Randrianasoloniaiko&apos;s petition also challenges the removal of three other bureau members, arguing the required serious grounds were not shown.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 05:51:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-ousted-assembly-president-asks-court-to-annul-ac0c15/share.jpg" length="45592" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-ousted-assembly-president-asks-court-to-annul-ac0c15/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar plans more water for Antananarivo&apos;s outskirts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-plans-more-water-for-antananarivo-s-outskirts-c24f03/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-plans-more-water-for-antananarivo-s-outskirts-c24f03/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>Three station upgrades are planned to add 10 800 m³ of drinking water a day to Jirama&apos;s network and serve districts around the capital.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
